# 検証 (e) : 表皮効果 — 高周波側 (古典的な表皮抵抗の漸近値)
#   l = 0.1 m, a = 1 mm, sigma = 5.8e7 S/m, f = 100 MHz (l = lambda/30)
#   delta = 6.60855e-6 m, a/delta = 151.3 >> 1 なので
#     Rin -> l / (2 pi a delta sigma) = 0.0415230 ohm
#   (厳密値は曲率補正 1 + delta/(2a) 分だけ約 +0.33% 大きい -> 許容 1%)
OpenPEEC 1 0
title = single wire with skin effect (high frequency)
skineffect = 1
node = 1 0 0 0
node = 2 0 0 0.1
wire = 0 0 0 0 0 0.1 1e-3 5.8e7 1
port = 1 2 50
frequency = 1e8 1e8 0
end
